#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Allow usage counts"
msgstr "Allow usage counts"

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Analytics ID for access or deletion:"
msgstr "Analytics ID for access or deletion:"

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Help improve Vela?"
msgstr "Help improve Vela?"

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "No thanks / turn off"
msgstr "No thanks / turn off"

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Optional usage counts help us see which screens work well. PostHog receives a random ID, screen names, opening times and time on screen. No names, family messages, photos, audio or recordings are included. This is separate from your family permissions. Choosing no changes nothing in Vela."
msgstr "Optional usage counts help us see which screens work well. PostHog receives a random ID, screen names, opening times and time on screen. No names, family messages, photos, audio or recordings are included. This is separate from your family permissions. Choosing no changes nothing in Vela."

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Storage region: European Union."
msgstr "Storage region: European Union."

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Storage region: United States."
msgstr "Storage region: United States."

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "The analytics service receives network details when your phone connects. Our free PostHog plan has a 1-year event reporting window in the configured region. This does not guarantee immediate deletion at its end. You can stop future counts here anytime. Turning this off clears this device's analytics identity; it does not delete earlier counts. For access or deletion, contact t.aiusheev@gmail.com."
msgstr "The analytics service receives network details when your phone connects. Our free PostHog plan has a 1-year event reporting window in the configured region. This does not guarantee immediate deletion at its end. You can stop future counts here anytime. Turning this off clears this device's analytics identity; it does not delete earlier counts. For access or deletion, contact t.aiusheev@gmail.com."

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Usage privacy"
msgstr "Usage privacy"

#: src/analytics/provider.tsx
msgid "Your choice could not be saved on this device. Counts are stopped for this session. Please choose turn off again to save it for future openings."
msgstr "Your choice could not be saved on this device. Counts are stopped for this session. Please choose turn off again to save it for future openings."
